              "text": "کیلومتر (kilometr) — \"a kilometre\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تا شهر بعدی صد کیلومتر راه است. Tâ shahr-e ba'di sad kilometr râh ast. It is a hundred kilometres to the next town."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Speed is kilometr dar sâ'at."
            }
          ]
        },
