              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "دور شدن (dur shodan) — \"to move away, to get further away\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "قایق کم کم از ساحل دور شد. Qâyeq kam-kam az sâhel dur shod. The boat slowly moved away from the shore."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "dur 'far' + shodan. The opposite is nazdik shodan."
            }
          ]
        },
